#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pan_self_learning_blueprint.field_pan_sl_blueprint_wizard__template
msgid ""
"A blueprint shipped with the module (data/blueprints). Models of apps that "
"are not installed are skipped and listed in the result."
msgstr ""
"Een blueprint die met de module wordt meegeleverd (data/blueprints). "
"Modellen van apps die niet geïnstalleerd zijn worden overgeslagen en in het "
"resultaat vermeld."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:pan_self_learning_blueprint.action_chain
msgid ""
"A chain (level 1) groups the processes of one end-to-end flow, such as lead "
"to cash or source to pay."
msgstr ""
"Een keten (niveau 1) groepeert de processen van één doorlopende stroom, "
"zoals lead to cash of source to pay."

