#: code:addons/pan_self_learning_blueprint/static/src/map/map_action.xml:0
msgid ""
"The map shows every activity of the company: phases from left to right,\n"
"                                roles from top to bottom. Start from a template blueprint or import your own."
msgstr ""
"De kaart toont elke activiteit van het bedrijf: fasen van links naar rechts,"
" rollen van boven naar beneden. Begin met een sjabloon-blueprint of "
"importeer je eigen bestand."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pan_self_learning_blueprint/models/blueprint.py:0
msgid "The new %(section)s record '%(code)s' needs a name."
msgstr "Het nieuwe record '%(code)s' in %(section)s heeft een naam nodig."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pan_self_learning_blueprint.field_pan_sl_role__group_ids
msgid ""
"The Odoo access groups people in this role need to do their activities."
msgstr ""
"De Odoo-toegangsgroepen die mensen in deze rol nodig hebben voor hun "
"activiteiten."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pan_self_learning_blueprint.field_pan_sl_phase__model_ids
msgid ""
"The Odoo documents (models) handled in this phase, for example quotations or"
" deliveries."
msgstr ""
"De Odoo-documenten (modellen) die in deze fase worden behandeld, "
"bijvoorbeeld offertes of leveringen."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pan_self_learning_blueprint.field_pan_sl_role__user_ids
msgid "The people who hold this role."
msgstr "De mensen die deze rol vervullen."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pan_self_learning_blueprint.field_pan_sl_adkar_score__user_id
msgid "The person this ADKAR score is about."
msgstr "De persoon over wie deze ADKAR-score gaat."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pan_self_learning_blueprint.field_pan_sl_chain__process_ids
msgid "The processes (level 2) that make up this chain."
msgstr "De processen (niveau 2) waaruit deze keten bestaat."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pan_self_learning_blueprint/models/blueprint.py:0
msgid "The section '%(section)s' must be a list."
msgstr "De sectie '%(section)s' moet een lijst zijn."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pan_self_learning_blueprint/models/blueprint.py:0
msgid "The sequence of '%(code)s' must be a whole number."
msgstr "De volgorde van '%(code)s' moet een geheel getal zijn."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pan_self_learning_blueprint.view_pan_sl_activity_form
msgid "The steps in Odoo, one per line. Becomes the manual and the exercise."
msgstr ""
"De stappen in Odoo, één per regel. Wordt de handleiding en de oefening."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pan_self_learning_blueprint/models/adkar.py:0
msgid "The survey round of %(user)s must be 1 or higher."
msgstr "De meetronde van %(user)s moet 1 of hoger zijn."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pan_self_learning_blueprint/models/blueprint.py:0
msgid "The template %(name)s does not exist."
msgstr "Het sjabloon %(name)s bestaat niet."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pan_self_learning_blueprint/models/blueprint.py:0
msgid ""
"This blueprint refers to Odoo models that are not installed: %(models)s. "
"Install the apps that provide them, or remove these models from the file."
msgstr ""
"Deze blueprint verwijst naar Odoo-modellen die niet geïnstalleerd zijn: "
"%(models)s. Installeer de apps die ze leveren, of haal deze modellen uit het"
" bestand."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pan_self_learning_blueprint/models/blueprint.py:0
msgid ""
"This is not a blueprint file: 'format' is %(found)r, expected %(expected)r."
msgstr ""
"Dit is geen blueprint-bestand: 'format' is %(found)r, verwacht %(expected)r."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pan_self_learning_blueprint.field_pan_sl_role__is_external
msgid ""
"Tick for roles outside the company, such as the customer or the supplier. "
"They are drawn at the edges of the map."
msgstr ""
"Aanvinken voor rollen buiten het bedrijf, zoals de klant of de leverancier. "
"Ze worden aan de randen van de kaart getekend."

#. module: pan_self_learning_blueprint
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pan_self_learning_blueprint/static/src/map/map_action.js:0
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:pan_self_learning_blueprint.selection__project_task__pan_rung__4
msgid "Trained"
msgstr "Getraind"

